  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken Tagine",
  "description": "This Moroccan stew is usually cooked in a clay tagine, but this recipe is modified for the slow cooker. This chicken tagine recipe will be a new favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "Holly Combs"
  ],
